# Prettier resolves its ignore file relative to the **working directory**, not the repository root,
# so the root `.prettierignore` does nothing when Prettier is invoked from inside this app. That is
# not hypothetical: running `npx prettier --write .` from here reformatted 70 files under `ios/` —
# CocoaPods' generated podspec JSON, Swift module ABI descriptors, and dSYM relocation YAML inside
# vendored xcframeworks. All regenerable, and all of it noise nobody should have to notice.
#
# This file exists so the mistake is impossible rather than merely discouraged.
ios/
android/
.expo/
